    "detailed_description": "<h1>Approved by Steam users</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650330/extras/569d79a5634add4763a5f78f73702b0a.avif?t=1752561629\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Until June 2017 all newly submitted games had to pass the public vote and receive approval from gamers worldwide in order to be published on Steam. We honour the memory of the Steam Greenlight system and would like to thank everyone who voted for Scarlet Scarf and was with us during that unforgettable time.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650330/extras/ef150f4233def57c8b190df71cd3b6d8.avif?t=1752561629\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650330/extras/21376314530f99b206066be78660d17c.avif?t=1752561629\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650330/extras/f2b53fb52761c5a312d3d6c93da6c13e.avif?t=1752561629\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650330/extras/8b7ca71eb6a8f281743c95d8bf79af61.avif?t=1752561629\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650330/extras/c7c4448a73cb14365e3606bbd1bf84a8.avif?t=1752561629\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650330/extras/ef150f4233def57c8b190df71cd3b6d8.avif?t=1752561629\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650330/extras/21376314530f99b206066be78660d17c.avif?t=1752561629\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650330/extras/f2b53fb52761c5a312d3d6c93da6c13e.avif?t=1752561629\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650330/extras/8b7ca71eb6a8f281743c95d8bf79af61.avif?t=1752561629\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650330/extras/c7c4448a73cb14365e3606bbd1bf84a8.avif?t=1752561629\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Scarlet Scarf is a visual novel inspired by the legend of Plague Maiden. Dive into the dark mysteries of a dying city with the fate of Sanator Richard Murdock in your hands. Perhaps it's not too late to stop the on-going calamity...",
    "supported_languages": "English, Russian",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe game lets you know it's dark fantasy right away. Dirty medieval period, full of dangers, malice and chthonic horror.\u201d<br>Yakov Gevorgizov, \u201cDarker\u201d magazine<br><br>\u201cThe prose in Sanator is good stuff, solemn and heavy, as befits its setting.\u201d<br>Jamie Durbin, The Mad Welshman<br><br>\u201cVisually, Sanator: Scarlet Scarf is stunning.\u201d<br>John Breeden, Game Industry News<br>",
